+# TLS certificate verification
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that TLS certificate verification stays enabled on all builds, with no exception for development builds. This is reinforced by the project's decision to enforce HTTPS everywhere, with no plaintext exception even for internal services, so development builds neither skip certificate verification nor fall back to plain HTTP.
